<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 14/15.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 14/15.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 14-15. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    July 14/15	July 11-14</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42278	    0.42207</p>
<p>    DKK    2.1004	     2.09911</p>
<p>    FIM    2.70089	    2.69269</p>
<p>    GBP   24.03266	   23.83697</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07458	    0.0743</p>
<p>    LTL    3.55705	    3.51104</p>
<p>    LVL   24.9127	    24.64227</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00246	    0.00243</p>
<p>    SEK    1.83566	    1.81874</p>
<p>    UAH    7.66405	    7.56941</p>
<p>    USD   14.2264	    14.0424</p>
<p>    XEU   15.76996	    15.74083</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
